{"id":"ab4a4945e54eb025","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-pcf4-ladder-uniformization.md","title":"ZFC Pcf4 Ladder Uniformization","display":"df-zfc-pcf4-ladder-uniformization — ZFC Pcf4 Ladder Uniformization","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf4-ladder-uniformization","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf4-ladder-uniformization"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf4-ladder-uniformization — ZFC Pcf4 Ladder Uniformization","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-pcf4-ladder-system]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf4-ladder-uniformization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf4-ladder-uniformization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf4-ladder-uniformization — ZFC Pcf4 Ladder Uniformization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"480300a437f3008f\" href=\"?note=480300a437f3008f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-pcf4-ladder-system\">58-df-zfc-pcf4-ladder-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,\\vec C,\\vec f,g,K,e\\in V\">\\(S,\\vec C,\\vec f,g,K,e\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4LadderSystem}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4LadderSystem}_S\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"480300a437f3008f\" href=\"?note=480300a437f3008f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-pcf4-ladder-system\">58-df-zfc-pcf4-ladder-system</a>) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e(\\delta)\">\\(e(\\delta)\\)</span> is a set-coded increasing enumeration of the ladder <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec C(\\delta)\">\\(\\vec C(\\delta)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4LadderUniformization}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4LadderUniformization}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf4\\text{-}ladder\\text{-}uniformization} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf4LadderUniformization}_S(S,\\vec C,\\vec f,g,K)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcPcf4LadderSystem}_S(S,\\vec C)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec f,S,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec f))\\land\\forall\\delta\\in S\\;\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec f(\\delta),\\omega,K)\\land\\exists e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(e,S,\\operatorname{ran}(e))\\land\\forall\\delta\\in S\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(e(\\delta),\\omega,\\vec C(\\delta))\\land\\operatorname{ran}(e(\\delta))=\\vec C(\\delta)\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(m&lt;n\\to e(\\delta)(m)&lt;e(\\delta)(n))\\bigr)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec C),K)\\land\\forall\\delta\\in S\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m\\geq n\\;(g(e(\\delta)(m))=\\vec f(\\delta)(m))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf4\\text{-}ladder\\text{-}uniformization} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf4LadderUniformization}_S(S,\\vec C,\\vec f,g,K)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcPcf4LadderSystem}_S(S,\\vec C)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec f,S,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec f))\\land\\forall\\delta\\in S\\;\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec f(\\delta),\\omega,K)\\land\\exists e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(e,S,\\operatorname{ran}(e))\\land\\forall\\delta\\in S\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(e(\\delta),\\omega,\\vec C(\\delta))\\land\\operatorname{ran}(e(\\delta))=\\vec C(\\delta)\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(m&lt;n\\to e(\\delta)(m)&lt;e(\\delta)(n))\\bigr)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec C),K)\\land\\forall\\delta\\in S\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m\\geq n\\;(g(e(\\delta)(m))=\\vec f(\\delta)(m))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-pcf4-ladder-system","status":"resolved","id":"480300a437f3008f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-pcf4-ladder-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-pcf4-ladder-system","status":"resolved","id":"480300a437f3008f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4LadderSystem}_S$ (see [[58-df-zfc-pcf4-ladder-system]]) and $\\mathrm{Function}$ (see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":